<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <!-- 装饰只有两团很淡的色晕。都收在右上角，用径向渐变淡到透明，
         所以没有硬边，也不会被切出一条直线。不挡字，也不吃点击。 -->
    <view class="glow glow-rose"></view>
    <view class="glow glow-pink"></view>
    <text class="eyebrow">一个人写的纪念册</text>
    <text class="hero-title">恋爱Wrapped</text>
    <text class="hero-sub">由你写下两个名字和一些小事。生成之后可以左右滑动，像翻一本只印了一份的小册子。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="paper">
    <text class="section-title">从这里开始</text>
    <text class="section-hint">纪念册至少要知道：你们怎么称呼彼此，以及从哪一天算起。</text>

    <view class="field-block">
      <text class="field-label">你的昵称</text>
      <input
        class="field"
        maxlength="10"
        placeholder="比如：小熊"
        placeholder-class="ph"
        cursor-spacing="80"
        value="{{form.myNickname}}"
        data-key="myNickname"
        bindinput="onInput"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="field-block">
      <text class="field-label">TA 的昵称</text>
      <input
        class="field"
        maxlength="10"
        placeholder="比如：阿树"
        placeholder-class="ph"
        cursor-spacing="80"
        value="{{form.theirNickname}}"
        data-key="theirNickname"
        bindinput="onInput"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="field-block">
      <text class="field-label">在一起的日子</text>
      <picker mode="date" value="{{form.togetherDate}}" start="1990-01-01" end="2035-12-31" bindchange="onDate">
        <view class="field field-picker">
          <text wx:if="{{togetherDateText}}">{{togetherDateText}}</text>
          <text wx:else class="ph">选择那一天</text>
        </view>
      </picker>
    </view>

    <text class="section-title section-gap">可以慢慢填</text>
    <text class="section-hint">空着也没关系。空着的那一页会用很轻的句子占着。只有「吵架」和「异地 / 同城」一项都不填，才不会多出页面。</text>

    <view class="field-block">
      <text class="field-label">第一次约会的地方</text>
      <input
        class="field"
        maxlength="20"
        placeholder="比如：学校西门的甜品店"
        placeholder-class="ph"
        cursor-spacing="80"
        value="{{form.firstDatePlace}}"
        data-key="firstDatePlace"
        bindinput="onInput"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="field-block">
      <text class="field-label">一起去过几座城市</text>
      <input
        class="field"
        type="number"
        maxlength="5"
        placeholder="比如：3"
        placeholder-class="ph"
        cursor-spacing="80"
        value="{{form.cityCount}}"
        data-key="cityCount"
        bindinput="onInput"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="field-block">
      <text class="field-label">一起吃过多少顿饭</text>
      <input
        class="field"
        type="number"
        maxlength="5"
        placeholder="比如：128"
        placeholder-class="ph"
        cursor-spacing="80"
        value="{{form.mealCount}}"
        data-key="mealCount"
        bindinput="onInput"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="field-block">
      <text class="field-label">吵架</text>
      <text class="field-help">次数和「谁先道歉」写了任意一项，纪念册里会多一页。都留空就没有这一页。</text>
      <input
        class="field"
        type="number"
        maxlength="5"
        placeholder="次数，可不填。比如：2"
        placeholder-class="ph"
        cursor-spacing="80"
        value="{{form.fightCount}}"
        data-key="fightCount"
        bindinput="onInput"
      />
      <radio-group class="choices" bindchange="onWho">
        <label class="choice {{form.whoApologized === '' ? 'on' : ''}}">
          <radio value="skip" checked="{{form.whoApologized === ''}}" color="#E85A7A" />
          <text>先不写</text>
        </label>
        <label class="choice {{form.whoApologized === 'me' ? 'on' : ''}}">
          <radio value="me" checked="{{form.whoApologized === 'me'}}" color="#E85A7A" />
          <text>我先道歉</text>
        </label>
        <label class="choice {{form.whoApologized === 'them' ? 'on' : ''}}">
          <radio value="them" checked="{{form.whoApologized === 'them'}}" color="#E85A7A" />
          <text>TA 先道歉</text>
        </label>
        <label class="choice {{form.whoApologized === 'both' ? 'on' : ''}}">
          <radio value="both" checked="{{form.whoApologized === 'both'}}" color="#E85A7A" />
          <text>几乎同时</text>
        </label>
      </radio-group>
    </view>

    <view class="field-block">
      <text class="field-label">口头禅</text>
      <input
        class="field"
        maxlength="24"
        placeholder="比如：到了跟我说一声"
        placeholder-class="ph"
        cursor-spacing="80"
        value="{{form.catchphrase}}"
        data-key="catchphrase"
        bindinput="onInput"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="field-block">
      <text class="field-label">一件难忘的小事</text>
      <textarea
        class="textarea"
        maxlength="140"
        placeholder="下雨天、一顿饭、一句没头没尾的话，都可以。"
        placeholder-class="ph"
        cursor-spacing="100"
        value="{{form.story}}"
        data-key="story"
        bindinput="onInput"
      />
      <text class="counter">{{storyCount}} / 140</text>
    </view>

    <view class="field-block">
      <text class="field-label">异地，还是同城</text>
      <text class="field-help">选了才会多出一页。异地填公里，同城填一起出门的次数。</text>
      <radio-group class="choices" bindchange="onDistance">
        <label class="choice {{form.distanceMode === '' ? 'on' : ''}}">
          <radio value="skip" checked="{{form.distanceMode === ''}}" color="#E85A7A" />
          <text>先不写</text>
        </label>
        <label class="choice {{form.distanceMode === 'ldr' ? 'on' : ''}}">
          <radio value="ldr" checked="{{form.distanceMode === 'ldr'}}" color="#E85A7A" />
          <text>我们异地</text>
        </label>
        <label class="choice {{form.distanceMode === 'same' ? 'on' : ''}}">
          <radio value="same" checked="{{form.distanceMode === 'same'}}" color="#E85A7A" />
          <text>同一座城</text>
        </label>
      </radio-group>
      <view wx:if="{{form.distanceMode === 'ldr'}}" class="follow">
        <text class="field-label">大约相隔多少公里</text>
        <input
          class="field"
          type="number"
          maxlength="5"
          placeholder="比如：842"
          placeholder-class="ph"
          cursor-spacing="80"
          value="{{form.distanceKm}}"
          data-key="distanceKm"
          bindinput="onInput"
        />
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{form.distanceMode === 'same'}}" class="follow">
        <text class="field-label">一起出门大概几次</text>
        <input
          class="field"
          type="number"
          maxlength="5"
          placeholder="比如：36"
          placeholder-class="ph"
          cursor-spacing="80"
          value="{{form.meetCount}}"
          data-key="meetCount"
          bindinput="onInput"
        />
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="field-block">
      <text class="field-label">想对 TA 说的一句话</text>
      <textarea
        class="textarea textarea-short"
        maxlength="40"
        placeholder="比如：明年还想和你一起吃西瓜。"
        placeholder-class="ph"
        cursor-spacing="120"
        value="{{form.sentence}}"
        data-key="sentence"
        bindinput="onInput"
      />
      <text class="counter">{{sentenceCount}} / 40</text>
    </view>

    <text class="error" wx:if="{{errorHint}}">{{errorHint}}</text>
    <view class="btn btn-primary {{canOpen ? '' : 'dim'}}" hover-class="pressed" bindtap="onGenerate">生成纪念册</view>
    <text class="count-line">按现在的内容，会生成 {{slideCount}} 页{{slideCount > 6 ? '，含你填了的额外页' : ''}}</text>

    <view class="btn btn-ghost sample-btn" hover-class="pressed" bindtap="onSample">填入一组示例</view>
    <text class="sample-note">示例是虚构的小熊和阿树：写了吵架和异地，所以会多出两页。换成你们的故事就好。</text>

    <view class="quiet" wx:if="{{hasStored}}" hover-class="pressed" bindtap="onClear">清空这台设备上的答案</view>
    <text class="privacy">不联网，不登录。清缓存或换一台设备之后，这些字会消失。</text>
  </view>
</view>
